  "description": "Rebuilt from the published description of Quercia, O'Hare & Cramer (2014). Pairwise comparisons of London street scenes on beauty, quiet and happiness, analysed as the share of times each scene was chosen. Differences from the original study: (1) The original site let participants continue after the first round of 10 pairs; this template asks one round (4 + 3 + 3 pairs). (2) The short questionnaire wording is not in the paper. (3) Bundled images are photographs from the paper PDF (19 scenes), not the original full stimulus set.",
